			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"备用提示词：\n\n1  \nA medium close-up of a confident, curvy woman with intense eyes and windswept hair, sweat glistening on her cheekbones. She’s dressed in a torn, midriff-baring tactical top that clings to her full bust. Camera slowly pulls back to reveal her toned body and the rifle held tight across her chest. She walks carefully through a shattered city street, camera tracking her sideways. Sunlight breaks through broken buildings, casting hard light and long shadows.   \n\n\n2  \nA busty woman wearing a dusty, tight crop-top reveals toned abs and cleavage as she steps cautiously through a ruined skyscraper lobby. The camera begins with a close-up of her focused expression, dirt smudged across her cheek, eyes scanning with intensity. It tilts down to her chest, catching the way the fabric clings, then dollies out to a wide shot revealing her silhouette against a fire-lit skyline. The mood is tense and cinematic, with orange and steel-blue contrast lighting. \n\n\n3 \nIn a foggy, war-torn alley, the camera pushes in toward a voluptuous woman crouching behind rubble. She wears a tight, belly-revealing combat outfit, her cleavage prominent. A close-up captures the strain in her face, lips parted, eyes flicking with alertness. As she rises and moves forward, the camera performs a slow tracking shot from below, enhancing her physicality. Volumetric light slices through the haze, highlighting flying ash and debris.  \n\n\n\n4  \nA slow-motion low-angle shot reveals a shapely woman walking across a crumbling overpass. Her tactical top hugs her chest and exposes her toned midriff. The camera pans upward as she halts and raises her rifle, transitioning to an intense close-up on her face—freckles, a small scar, and narrowed eyes full of focus. Sparks fall in the background from a burning structure. The lighting is moody, combining flickering orange glow with cool rim lighting.  \n\n5 \n\nTight close-up on a woman’s face, sweat and dust streaking her skin as she breathes heavily. Her glossy lips part as she listens for danger. The camera slowly pulls back to reveal her full, curvy figure in a cropped battle top that exposes her flat stomach and ample bust. She moves through a collapsed parking garage. The shot becomes a handheld-style tracking sequence, slightly shaking with her steps. Beams of hard light slash through the darkness, casting dramatic shadows.  \n"
